# FoodHerons — Phase A seed script env template.
# Copy to supabase/scripts/.env and fill in real values. The real .env is
# git-ignored; this .env.example (placeholders only) is tracked.
#
# The service-role key bypasses RLS — treat it as a secret. NEVER commit it,
# NEVER put it in any VITE_-prefixed var or the frontend bundle.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Optional: override the shared demo vendor password (demo-only; the script
# defaults to FoodHerons!Demo2026 if unset). Rotate/delete before production.
# SEED_VENDOR_PASSWORD=
